# Optional. The application works out-of-the-box WITHOUT a key:
#   - live mode falls back to NASA FIRMS open global CSV feeds (24h / 7d)
#   - if the network is unavailable it falls back to cached data, then to a
#     clearly-labelled synthetic snapshot.
# A MAP_KEY enables the area-restricted FIRMS API (MODIS_NRT, VIIRS_SNPP_NRT,
# VIIRS_NOAA20_NRT). Get one free at https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=

HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
